exports[`하단 도구줄 배치 (컨셉 A) > 순서: + → 엔진 칩 → 인증 칩(구독/API) → 권한 칩 → 모드 칩 → (오른쪽 끝) 전송, 아래 판정 줄 (스냅샷) 1`] = `"<div class="hx-composer"><textarea class="hx-composer__input" aria-label="지시 입력" rows="2" placeholder="지시를 입력하세요 (Enter 전송 · Shift+Enter 줄바꿈)"></textarea><div class="hx-composer__bar" role="toolbar" aria-label="입력 도구"><button type="button" class="hx-plus" aria-label="추가" data-slot="plus">+</button><div class="hx-chip-wrap hx-chip--engine"><button type="button" class="hx-chip" aria-label="엔진: Claude Code" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span><span>Claude Code</span><span class="hx-chip__caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button></div><div class="hx-chip-wrap hx-chip--auth"><button type="button" class="hx-chip" aria-label="인증: 구독" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><span>구독</span><span class="hx-chip__caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button></div><div class="hx-chip-wrap hx-chip--permission"><button type="button" class="hx-chip" aria-label="권한: 워크스페이스 쓰기" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span><span>워크스페이스 쓰기</span><span class="hx-chip__caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button></div><div class="hx-chip-wrap hx-chip--mode"><button type="button" class="hx-chip" aria-label="모드: 일반" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><span>일반</span><span class="hx-chip__caret" aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button></div><span class="hx-composer__spacer"></span><button type="button" class="hx-send" aria-label="전송" disabled="">↑</button></div><div class="hx-verdict" aria-live="polite" data-testid="verdict"><span data-passed="true">판정 · 항목 <span class="hx-mono">2.1</span> 통과 · 사다리 2번째 칸(별칭 사전)</span></div></div>"`;
